[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1308","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0596","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.x ActiveX 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.x 存在代码执行漏洞，被称为 \"IE Script\" 漏洞。漏洞原理是 IE 在解析 HTML 文档中的 ActiveX OBJECT 标签引用 Microsoft Access 数据库文件时，未提示用户确认直接自动打开，导致远程攻击者可构造恶意网页嵌入恶意 Access 文件，诱导用户访问即可在用户系统上下文下执行任意命令。影响范围为 Internet Explorer 5.x 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属高危漏洞。攻击条件为远程攻击者构造恶意网页并诱导用户访问，利用方式为通过 ActiveX OBJECT 标签引用恶意 Access 数据库文件实现远程代码执行。Microsoft 已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0596"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-27T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04.603","remediation":"升级 Internet Explorer 到支持安全更新的版本（IE 6 及以上），并安装 2000 年 6 月发布的累积安全补丁包；同时通过系统设置禁用不信任 ActiveX 控件，启用增强安全配置（ESC 模式），并在应用程序信任区启用“提示下载前检查”功能以防止自动执行包含 Access 文件的 HTML 对象标签，如需临时缓解可在防火墙策略中阻止 IE 读取 Access 文件扩展","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-16.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1398","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=000d01bfe0fb%24418f59b0%2496217aa8%40src.bu.edu","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=39589359.762392DB%40nat.bg","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-049","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0596.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0596","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0596.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0596.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hqf4-9x6j-98g9/GHSA-hqf4-9x6j-98g9.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0596.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0596.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--83464f4c-2053-49dd-abe1-6e769ba73c3b.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/46c3db74bcefc7346a3fc9a83eaa82e521022c79/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1308.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0699","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0699.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0593","title":"SapporoWorks WinProxy 2.0/2.0.1 HTTP GET 请求处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SapporoWorks WinProxy 2.0 及 2.0.1 版本的 HTTP 服务器组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者在未指定 HTTP 版本号的情况下发送特制的 GET 请求，可导致代理服务器程序崩溃，造成服务不可用。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 WinProxy 2.0/2.0.1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0593"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-27T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04.187","remediation":"升级至 SapporoWorks WinProxy 2.0.2 或更高版本以修复该拒绝服务漏洞。若无法获取更新版本，请在 HTTP 服务器配置中添加请求版本号校验规则，拒绝缺少 HTTP 版本头的 GET 请求，或在前端部署反向代理服务器过滤异常 HTTP 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1400","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200006271417.GFE84146.-BJXON%40lac.co.jp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4831","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0593.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0593","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0593.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d927d63ee32587ef80d9e763226701b1dc32c67d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0593.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r33h-6mqf-5rp3/GHSA-r33h-6mqf-5rp3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0593.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1400/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--30006da0-3f15-476f-94c6-c793974a5d87.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0699.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0471","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0471.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0592","title":"SapporoWorks WinProxy POP3服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SapporoWorks WinProxy 2.0 及 2.0.1 版本的 POP3 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向 POP3 服务发送超长的 USER、PASS、LIST、RETR 或 DELE 命令参数，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 WinProxy 2.0 和 2.0.1 版本，攻击者利用此漏洞可完全控制受影响的代理服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0592"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-27T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04.063","remediation":"立即升级 WinProxy 至 2.0.2 及以上版本（该漏洞已在 2.0.2 中修复）。如无法升级，在 POP3 服务入口实施严格的输入长度校验，限制 USER、PASS、LIST、RETR、DELE 命令参数不超过 64 字节，并在防火墙层面限制 POP3 端口（110/TCP）仅允许可信源 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1400","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200006271417.GFE84146.-BJXON%40lac.co.jp","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0592.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0592","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0592.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d927d63ee32587ef80d9e763226701b1dc32c67d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0592.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m5jq-cp4v-64qc/GHSA-m5jq-cp4v-64qc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0592.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1400/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0471.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0452","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0452.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0570","title":"Centrinity FirstClass Intranet Server 邮件长头部拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Centrinity FirstClass Intranet Server 邮件处理系统存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可向目标服务器发送包含超长邮件头（To: 字段）的电子邮件，触发邮箱服务程序的缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃或严重错误，引发拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响所有版本低于 6.1 的 FirstClass 邮件服务器（含 5.770 版本）。攻击者无需任何权限即可远程发起攻击，只要精心构造的恶意邮件即可轻易触发。漏洞源于邮件服务程序在处理异常长邮件头时，未进行充分的边界检查和内存保护措施。攻击者可反复发送恶意邮件，导致受害服务器邮件服务瘫痪，严重影响企业网络通信。该漏洞的 CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级为中度，对企业级 Intranet Server 构成了严重威胁。这类电子邮件 头 溢 出 类 型 遭 频 繁 遭 到 视 为 门 类 流 行 的 DOS 攻 击手 段，响 应 了 早 期I n t r a n e t 服 务 器 类 易 受 攻 击 的 状 态。 (83字)","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0570"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-27T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01.190","remediation":"升级 Centrinity FirstClass Intranet Server 至 6.1 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可在邮件网关或防火墙层面配置规则限制 To: 邮件头长度（建议 ≤256 字符），或暂时禁用不必要的邮件服务端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0295.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5718","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1421","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4843","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20052","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0570.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0570","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0570.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0570.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mxfj-2pw5-7crq/GHSA-mxfj-2pw5-7crq.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0570.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0570.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0452.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1306","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0587","title":"glftpd FTP服务器 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"glftpd 1.18 的 privpath 指令存在安全绕过漏洞，允许远程攻击者利用文件名自动补全功能绕过目录访问限制，访问未授权的文件和目录。该漏洞影响 glftpd 1.18 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级极高。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可发起攻击，通过构造特殊文件名触发补全机制，从而绕过 privpath 指令定义的路径访问控制，可能导致敏感文件泄露或系统未授权访问。开发者应在官方渠道确认后升级至修复版本，并严格配置 privpath 指令限制可访问路径。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0587"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03.443","remediation":"升级 glftpd 至 v2.16 或更高版本，该版本已修复 privpath 指令的文件名补全绕过问题。升级前请备份 glftpd.conf 配置文件和用户数据库。如无法立即升级，应在 glftpd.conf 中注释或删除 privpath 相关配置项，同时在防火墙层限制 FTP 服务的访问源地址，仅允许可信 IP 连接，以临时缓解目录访问绕过风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0317.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1401","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.10006261041360.31907-200000%40twix.thrijswijk.nl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/359275c189930ab08ca487bc0726b002a25eef84/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0587.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0587","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0587/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/98c25b568de9f5663060bd4b7b00b621bdb6209c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0587.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/58ee4ff7906d19f4609c9ca9aa75dfba481e1462/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0587.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0587.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0587.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0712","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0712.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0600","title":"Netscape Enterprise Server 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NetWare 5.1 操作系统上的 Netscape Enterprise Server 服务器存在安全漏洞。攻击者无需任何身份验证即可远程向目标服务器发送包含恶意构造的 URL 包，由于服务器解析 URL 时未对输入进行充分验证，可能会导致服务器崩溃或进程异常退出，从而引发服务拒绝（DoS）事故。同时，由于漏洞的存在，攻击者还有可能通过精心构造的恶意外链到达服务器执行任意命令，完全控制服务器的运行权限。该漏洞影响范围主要集中在 NetWare 5.1 操作系统环境下的 Netscape Enterprise Server 产品，攻击条件简单，利用途径直接，攻击者可以在网络中对目标服务器进行主动扫描，定位到漏洞存在的服务器端口后即可实施攻击。漏洞的 CVSS 评分高达 7.5，威胁等级为高危，对用户系统信息安全和服务器的稳定运行构成严重威胁。微软亚太研发中心已针对这一漏洞制定相关的安全补丁方案，建议安装安全更新以全面弥补该安全漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0600"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05.120","remediation":"建议立即从Netscape/Netscape产品官方网站下载并安装NetWare 5.1 SP2及更高版本的Enterprise Server，获取针对CVE-2000-0600的安全补丁包；或在物理上升级至NetWare 6.5+版本；同时在web服务器配置文件中限制URL长度并验证URL格式，将用户输入的URL参数进行严格校验，避免包含特殊字符和异常长度的URL请求，通过使用ip地址+端口+路径模式替代主机名解析来减少风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0264.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1393","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4780","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0600.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0600","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6bd2f3671962f9ee453128567db1f722844715d5/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0600.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0600.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fpcj-q3j2-7545/GHSA-fpcj-q3j2-7545.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0600.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0916419c-a403-4ef8-b616-6aa83b6fe38c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0712.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0705","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0705.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0598","title":"Fortech Proxy+ 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Fortech Proxy+ 存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 Telnet 代理重定向连接，绕过管理服务的访问限制，导致未授权访问管理功能。影响 Fortech Proxy+ 相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响完整性。攻击者无需认证即可通过 Telnet 代理转发连接绕过管理接口访问控制，实现未授权管理访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0598"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04.870","remediation":"建议将 Fortech Proxy+ 升级至厂商发布的安全修复版本（参考 http://www.proxyplus.cz 补丁公告），或禁用 telnet 代理功能以阻止攻击者重定向连接至管理服务。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙或路由器层面禁止外部主机访问 Proxy+ 管理服务端口，仅允许可信内部 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0268.html","http://www.proxyplus.cz/faq/articles/EN/art01002.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1395","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0598.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0598","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0598.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0598.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-45rv-3qw6-q326/GHSA-45rv-3qw6-q326.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0598.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_bypass.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0705.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0705.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0467","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0467.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0588","title":"Flowerfire SawMill 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Flowerfire SawMill 5.0.21 的 CGI 程序存在信息泄露漏洞，攻击者通过向 rfcf 参数提交任意文件路径，服务器会将该文件内容作为配置命令解析并返回首行内容，从而泄露服务器上的敏感信息。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，影响运行 SawMill 5.0.21 的 Web 服务器，攻击者可通过构造简单的 HTTP 请求即可读取服务器上任意文件的第一行内容，可能导致配置文件、日志文件等敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0588"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03.573","remediation":"建议立即升级 Sawmill 至修复后的最新版本。如暂无法升级，可在 Web 服务器配置中禁用或限制 Sawmill CGI 程序的访问权限，仅允许来自可信 IP 地址的请求，并对 rfcf 参数实施严格的输入过滤，防止任意文件被读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0271.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0080.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1402","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20041","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/700a72edb590fb1f0e5939ac4fed7cdb65918fb1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0588.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0588","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/98c25b568de9f5663060bd4b7b00b621bdb6209c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0588.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/10de5f989525302a3452d86be5a85058aa88a086/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0588.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3d38e52d54486e18e46757279b6f729e4988de14/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cvw6-7vx8-mh9x/GHSA-cvw6-7vx8-mh9x.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/sawmill.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0588.json","https://github.com/lcashdol/advisories/blob/32733f854e018593b94f048e59ce3442a76d2767/advisory-37.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0467.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0741","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0741.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0616","title":"HP TurboIMAGE DBUTIL 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP TurboIMAGE 是 HP MPE/iX 系统上的数据库管理系统，其 DBUTIL 工具（DBUTIL.PUB.SYS）存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过执行特制的 DBUTIL 命令获取额外系统权限，实现机密性、完整性和可用性部分破坏。该漏洞源于 DBUTIL 对用户权限检查不充分，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限。CVSS v2 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0616"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-06-26","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"HP 已发布安全公告 HPSBMP-2000-006 修复此漏洞。建议立即安装 HP 官方补丁，或临时移除 DBUTIL.PUB.SYS 的 setuid/setgid 权限，限制仅管理员可执行该程序，并启用本地日志审计。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T11:47:23.595180681+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0741.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0475","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0475.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0601","title":"LeafDigital LeafChat 1.7 错误消息拒绝服务漏洞","description":"LeafDigital LeafChat 1.7 存在错误消息处理缺陷导致的拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可通过发送特制的错误消息或触发异常错误条件，导致客户端崩溃或服务拒绝，影响 LeafChat 1.7 版本客户端用户。攻击者需诱导受害者接收恶意构造的错误消息或连接至恶意服务器触发异常，随后客户端因异常处理不当而崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞无需认证即可远程触发，影响聊天客户端可用性，攻击者可通过发送畸形数据包或诱导连接恶意服务器实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0601"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-25","updated":"2000-06-25","remediation":"立即升级到最新版本的 LeafChat（如果还有的话），建议访问官方网站下载最新版本。如果无法立即升级，可以在防火墙层面阻止意外的 IRC 错误消息流向 LeafChat 客户端，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20039","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0601.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0601","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6bd2f3671962f9ee453128567db1f722844715d5/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0601.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0601.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x5rf-j496-m69m/GHSA-x5rf-j496-m69m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0601.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0475.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1300","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0585","title":"ISC DHCP client 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"ISC DHCP 客户端程序 dhclient 存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 DHCP 响应报文中注入 shell 元字符，使客户端在处理 DHCP 选项时执行任意系统命令。由于 DHCP 客户端通常以 root 权限运行，攻击者无需身份认证即可在目标系统上获得完全控制权，造成机密性、完整性和可用性的全面破坏。该漏洞影响运行 ISC DHCP 客户端的主流 Linux 及 Unix 类操作系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者可在目标主机接入网络时，通过伪造 DHCP 服务器响应向客户端发送特制数据包完成利用，建议升级至 ISC DHCP 已修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0585"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03.183","remediation":"立即将 ISC DHCP 客户端升级到 dhclient 2.0pl3 及以上（2.x 系列）或 3.0b1pl17 及以上（3.x 系列）；FreeBSD 用户可升级至 4.1-RELEASE 或之后基系统（已含 2.0pl3）。Debian 用户请安装官方安全更新后的 dhcp-client / dhcp-client-beta 包。若暂时无法升级，在 /etc/rc.conf 或网络配置文件中将 DHCP 客户端禁用，改为静态 IP 配置并重启网络服务，避免从不可信 DHCP 服务器获取配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0247.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0014.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000628","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_56.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1388","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4772","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0ff539514ffae70ea73031a227022cb4e6068a50/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0585.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0585","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0585/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e10c449b2000a2439910055eb21748030356eb7d/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0585.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e8cef73228affbb0d7f27f3d9e33baf98c2660a4/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0585.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/734adcc0a68fbe95325e836d2469be64740b89d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-c3g3-gg38-8jjw/GHSA-c3g3-gg38-8jjw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0585.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2000/20000628.data","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0585.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1300.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1300.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0735","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0735.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0611","title":"NetWin DMailWeb/CWMail POP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetWin DMailWeb 和 CWMail 2.6g 版本的 POP 服务器默认配置信任所有 POP 服务器，存在信任配置缺陷导致的拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程访问目标 POP 服务器，利用默认信任配置绕过正常身份验证机制，向服务器发送恶意请求导致服务拒绝，造成服务不可用。该漏洞影响 NetWin DMailWeb 和 CWMail 2.6g 版本的 POP 服务组件，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），主要影响系统可用性。NetWin 已在后续版本中修复该默认配置缺陷，建议用户升级至修复版本或修改默认信任配置限制可信 POP 服务器列表。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0611"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-23T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06.450","remediation":"建议立即升级 NetWin DMailWeb 和 CWMail 至 2.7 或更高版本，并在 POP 服务器配置中明确指定受信任的 POP 服务器地址列表，禁止默认信任所有 POP 服务器。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制 POP 服务端口（110/995）仅允许受信任 IP 访问，并配置 POP 服务器白名单作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0243.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1391","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4771","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0611.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0611","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0611.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0611.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cf29-9472-gh5p/GHSA-cf29-9472-gh5p.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0611.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0611.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--eccdfd2b-d0b6-4fe0-a076-d077238e822c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0735.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0733","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0733.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0610","title":"NetWin dMailWeb/cwMail 认证绕过漏洞","description":"NetWin dMailWeb 和 cwMail 2.6g 及早期版本存在认证绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过在用户名中插入回车字符（%0D）绕过身份验证机制，利用服务器进行邮件中继攻击。该漏洞源于对用户名输入缺乏对控制字符的过滤，导致认证逻辑被绕过。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等），影响完整性。影响范围为 NetWin dMailWeb 和 cwMail 2.6g 及早期版本，攻击者可远程匿名利用，将服务器作为开放邮件中继发送垃圾邮件。建议升级至 2.6g 以降版本或应用厂商补丁修复输入验证缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0610"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-23T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06.333","remediation":"建议立即升级 NetWin dMailWeb 和 cwMail 至 2.6g 以上版本（建议升级至最新版本）。若暂时无法升级，可在邮件服务器前置防火墙层面拦截包含回车符（%0D 或 %0A）的用户名请求，并在 SMTP 服务器配置中禁用开放中继功能，仅允许经过认证的用户发送邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0243.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1390","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4770","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0610.json","https://github.com/LiuCan0