games/cconq`）作为临时缓解措施，或通过 env 限制 DISPLAY 变量长度（`env DISPLAY=$(printf '%.200s' \"$DISPLAY\") xconq`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0222.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0618.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0618","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0618.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0618.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x4xf-2prm-xx25/GHSA-x4xf-2prm-xx25.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0618.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/cee5a3b524678beb8613152453ffdb7e3eac41b4/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0744.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0654","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0654.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0562","title":"ISS BlackICE Defender UDP阻塞延迟漏洞","description":"BlackICE 高 UDP 阻塞延迟漏洞是 Internet Security Systems 公司 BlackICE 安全软件中的一个安全漏洞。该软件在安全设置为“Nervous”或更低级别时，无法正确过滤 Back Orifice 恶意流量。当攻击者向目标系统发送特制的数据包时，软件会延迟或完全忽略这些威胁，导致恶意连接建立。受影响的产品包括 BlackIce Defender 2.1 及更早版本，以及 BlackIce Pro 2.0.23 及更早版本。攻击者无需任何身份验证即可远程触发此漏洞，通过控制恶意流量绕过安全过滤系统，窃取敏感数据和控制权。该漏洞影响范围较广，因为 BlackICE 是企业网络安全的重要组成部分，许多组织当时都在使用该软件进行网络防护。该漏洞的 CVSS 评分为 7.5，威胁等级为中高。攻击条件包括目标系统安装了受影响版本的 BlackICE 安全软件、安全设置处于 Nervous 或更低级别，且 attacker 可以向目标发送恶意 UDP 数据包。利用方式包括发送特制的数据包绕过安全过滤，或利用软件延迟响应的机制建立恶意连接。漏洞成因在于 Back Orifice 的特定数据包格式被误认为是合法网络流量，导致安全软件未能将其阻断，从而为攻击者提供了入侵网络系统的机会。微软已在 2000 年 9 月的安全更新中修复了此漏洞，建议所有用户立即更新到最新版本以获取保护。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0562"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00.177","remediation":"立即升级到 BlackIce 4.x 及以上版本，应用 2003 年 3 月安全更新包；将安全设置为“高”或“严格”，禁用脆弱的“Nervous”设置；如无法立即更新，可通过防火墙策略禁用出站 UDP 端口 1024-65535 流量，并启用入站 Back Orifice 识别规则。”","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0190.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0562.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0562","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0562.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0562.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v25j-6rjr-73r2/GHSA-v25j-6rjr-73r2.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/blackice_version_checker.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0562.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0562.md","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--5482b69f-a7e7-4b0a-9ae5-6f420c2543d4.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0654.toml"}]